  "rationale": "The plant models robot motion and perception as separate automata. The specification encodes safe, progress-oriented exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, rotate to recover from obstacles, and full_rotate only as last resort. All obstacle events force recovery before resuming exploration. No controllable loops or unsafe actions in obstacle states.",
